bf6c0d8728328e.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:52927/passei-no-exame-ex316-red-hat-certified-specialist-in-openshift-virtualization/images/openshift-virtualization-score-1024x453_hu_26bf6c0d8728328e.png 800w, http://localhost:52927/passei-no-exame-ex316-red-hat-certified-specialist-in-openshift-virtualization/images/openshift-virtualization-score-1024x453.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:52927/passei-no-exame-ex316-red-hat-certified-specialist-in-openshift-virtualization/images/openshift-virtualization-score-1024x453.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;Tive a oportunidade de fazer o curso oficial para este exame, o mesmo estava em promoção junto com o exame, então acabei pagando apenas 30% do valor.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
